      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-can-you-build"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What can you build?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Custom builds</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-team"/></svg></i><b>Customer portal</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-cal"/></svg></i><b>Booking system</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><b>Dashboard</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></i><b>Approval tool</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg></i><b>Staff app (web)</b><em>Yes</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>Large platform</b><em>Assess first</em></span></div></div></div><p>Customer portals, booking systems, dashboards and internal tools, built around defined users and workflows. Each build defines its screens, user roles, data, permissions, acceptance criteria and deployment before we start.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-a-custom-web-app-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does a custom web app cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Prices</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div><b>MVP</b><small>1 workflow · 6 screens · 2 roles</small><em>RM15,000</em></div><div class="on"><b>Workflow</b><small>3 workflows · 12 screens · 1 integration</small><em>RM30,000</em></div><div><b>Platform</b><small>5 workflows · 20 screens · 2 integrations</small><em>RM60,000</em></div></div></div></div><p>It is a one-time project. MVP is from RM15,000 for 1 core workflow, up to 6 main screens, 2 user roles, login with structured records, basic admin and export, and 30-day defect support. Workflow is from RM30,000 for up to 3 workflows, 12 main screens, 3 user roles, 1 standard integration, a dashboard with permissions and 60-day defect support. Platform is from RM60,000 for up to 5 workflows, 20 main screens, 4 user roles, 2 standard integrations, advanced reporting scope and 90-day defect support. The final quotation depends on workflow complexity and technical discovery.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-counts-as-a-main-screen"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What counts as a main screen?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Main screens</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Jobs list</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Booking form</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Customer profile</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Dashboard</p><p class="x"><em>+</em>Complex functions are scoped on their own</p></div></div></div><p>A main screen is a main view, such as a jobs list, a booking form, a customer profile or a dashboard. Small pop-ups and dialogs inside a screen don’t count separately. Complex functions, like a pricing engine or a route planner, are scoped individually.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-is-included"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What is included?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Included</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Discovery</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Interface design</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Scoped build and testing</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Deployment guidance</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Handover session</p><p class="x"><em>+</em>Hosting, licences, migration: separate</p></div></div></div><p>Every package includes discovery, interface design, the scoped build, testing, deployment guidance and a handover session. Hosting, licences, data migration and ongoing feature work are separate unless they are listed in your quotation.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-it-connect-to-our-other-tools"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can it connect to our other tools?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Integrations</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-link"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wa"/></svg></i><b>WhatsApp</b><em>Standard</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><b>Payment gateway</b><em>Standard</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><b>Accounting</b><em>Standard</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><b>Google Sheets</b><em>Standard</em></span></div></div></div><p>Yes. Workflow includes 1 standard integration and Platform includes 2, for example WhatsApp messages, a payment gateway, accounting software or Google Sheets. MVP has none included. More connections can be added through our API integration service.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-we-start-small-and-add-more-later"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can we start small and add more later?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Phases</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-spark"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Phase 1 · MVP</b><small>One core workflow, live and in use</small></span><em class="g">Start</em></p><p><span><b>Phase 2</b><small>More workflows from real feedback</small></span><em class="g">Quoted</em></p><p><span><b>Phase 3</b><small>Integrations and reporting</small></span><em class="g">Quoted</em></p></div></div></div><p>Yes, that is how we recommend starting. Launch one core workflow as an MVP, see how your team and customers use it, then add workflows in later phases. New features after launch are quoted as separate work.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-who-looks-after-it-after-launch"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Who looks after it after launch?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>After launch</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Defect support</b><small>MVP 30 · Workflow 60 · Platform 90 days</small></span><em class="g">Included</em></p><p><span><b>System Care</b><small>1 system · monitoring + bug fixes · 1.5 h</small></span><em class="g">RM399/mo</em></p><p><span><b>System Care Plus</b><small>Up to 3 systems · monthly review · 5 h</small></span><em class="g">RM999/mo</em></p><p><span><b>System Priority</b><small>Up to 6 systems · priority queue · 10 h</small></span><em class="g">RM1,999/mo</em></p></div></div></div><p>We fix defects for 30 days with MVP, 60 days with Workflow and 90 days with Platform. After that, System care keeps it running: System Care is RM399 a month (1 system, monitoring and bug fixes, 1.5 hours), System Care Plus RM999 (up to 3 systems, monthly review, 5 hours) and System Priority RM1,999 (up to 6 systems, priority queue and report, 10 hours).</p></div></div></article>
